  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"p1\">Geli is a sleep wellness brand focused on better support, pressure relief, and restorative rest. Founded by sleep innovators Tara and Todd Youngblood, Geli creates thoughtfully designed products that help customers build a healthier and more comfortable sleep environment.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">Our lineup includes the Geli Pillow, the Geli Sova Mattress, and the Geli Organic by Essentia. The Geli Pillow supports the head and neck while helping reduce pressure points. The Geli Sova Mattress features a unique water-based support system for adaptive comfort and customizable pressure relief. The Geli Organic by Essentia offers a premium organic mattress option for customers seeking a cleaner, more natural sleep surface.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">Geli is different because we combine sleep innovation, wellness education, and real product performance. Our products are designed for customers who want more than a basic mattress or pillow. They want better support, better comfort, and a better night’s sleep.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">Affiliates can earn commission by sharing their unique Geli affiliate link or discount code. Geli is a strong fit for creators in sleep, wellness, recovery, fitness, parenting, home, chiropractic, massage, organic living, and lifestyle spaces.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">Affiliates can promote Geli through product reviews, social posts, reels, stories, blog content, email newsletters, gift guides, and sleep education. Strong angles include pressure relief, neck support, recovery, organic sleep, couples’ comfort, and building a healthier sleep routine.</p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">Geli is looking for partners who want to share helpful, honest sleep education and introduce their audience to products designed to support better rest.</p></div></div>",
